First a well known and a crucial lemma:
<span style="color:#6FA8DC">**Lemma:**</span>    Let  $\overline{AD},\overline{BE},\overline{CF}$  be altitudes of  $\triangle ABC$  with orthocenter  $H$ .Also let  $M$  be the midpoint of  $\overline{BC}$ .Let  $EF$  intersect the circumcircle of  $\triangle ABC$  at  $X,Y$ .Then  $(XYDM)$  is cyclic.


[asy]
