<span style="color:#6FA8DC">*Proof:*</span>    Denote  $K= \overline{EF} \cap \overline{BC}$ .Now remark that  $(DMFE)$  is cyclic as it is the nine point circle of  $\triangle ABC$  and  $(BFEC)$  is cyclic trivially.Now by power of point we have   $$ KY \cdot KX = KB \cdot KC=KF \cdot KE = KD \cdot KM $$   and by power of point  $(XYDM)$  is cyclic  $\square$ [asy]
