Now coming back to the problem let  $U = \overline{AT} \cap \overline{PQ}$ .Now by shooting lemma   $$ MX \cdot MS = MQ^2 = MU \cdot MT $$   Whence  $(TUXS)$  is cyclic and so  $\angle TUS = 90^{\circ}$ .

