    \Longrightarrow ~ & TM^2 = AN^2 + MN^2 - AP^2.
    \end{align*}
    By Lemma 4.33 of EGMO, observe that  $AP^2 = (AX)(AS) = AN^2 - NX^2$ .  Thus,
