Note that  $\frac{x^2}{x-1} = x \cdot \frac{x}{x-1} = x + \frac{x}{x-1}$ .

We use GM-HM on  $x$  and  $\frac{x}{x-1}$ .
\begin{align*}
\sqrt{\frac{x^2}{x-1}} &\geq \frac{2}{\frac{1}{x} + \frac{x-1}{x}} 
\sqrt{\frac{x^2}{x-1}} &\geq 2 
\frac{x^2}{x-1} &\geq 4 
\end{align*}

Equality case when  $x = x / (x-1)$ , which is when  $x = 2$ .

